### IDEA HTTP Client：完整业务环境，所有请求默认走网关。
### 使用前修改请求号；重复提交同一请求号是幂等实验，会保留原购买参数与快照。
@gateway = http://localhost:8100
@order = http://localhost:8102
@localNo = order-local-demo-0001
@globalNo = order-global-demo-0001
@eventId = replace-with-event-id

### 正常用户；200，响应有 X-Request-Id / X-Service-Instance
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/1
X-Request-Id: manual-user-check

### 不存在用户；404
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/999

### 商品展示，数据库或 Redis 缓存
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/1001

### 库存快照
GET {{gateway}}/api/stocks/1001

### 正常预览；不生成订单或扣库存
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":2}

### 禁用用户；409
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":2,"productId":1001,"quantity":2}

### 数量非法；400
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":0}

### LOCAL 下单；重复提交后核对只扣一次库存
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-local-order

{"requestNo":"{{localNo}}","userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":2}

### 查询原订单
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{localNo}}

### LOCAL 结果未知时原号重试；不更换购买参数，不重新报价
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{localNo}}/retry

### 同号不同数量；409
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestNo":"{{localNo}}","userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":3}

### GLOBAL 下单；需先启用订单、库存的 Seata
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/atomic
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-global-order

{"requestNo":"{{globalNo}}","userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":1}

### 查询 GLOBAL 原号，检查 transactionMode / globalXid
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{globalNo}}

### LOCAL 请求号不得混用 GLOBAL；409
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/atomic
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestNo":"{{localNo}}","userId":1,"productId":1001,"quantity":2}

### 查询确认事件；把返回的事件 ID 填到文件顶部 eventId
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/events/by-order/{{localNo}}

### 查询通知；SENT 不保证消费已完成，允许等待异步处理后再查
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications/orders/{{localNo}}

### 人工重试失败事件；先替换 eventId 并确认事件状态
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/events/{{eventId}}/retry

### 人工重放一条死信；仅在修复原因后执行，成功投递仍需查询通知
POST {{gateway}}/api/notifications/dead-letters/replay-one

### 商品更新；先查询当前 version 并填写，重复旧版本应返回409
PUT {{gateway}}/api/products/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"学习笔记本","price":39.90,"enabled":true,"version":0}

### 业务配置刷新；此端点直接访问订单服务，不经网关
GET {{order}}/learning/config

### 订单 OpenAPI
GET {{order}}/v3/api-docs

### 服务健康检查
GET {{order}}/actuator/health
